# Safety net for a PUBLIC, CDN-served data repo. The build process only
# writes curated open-data JSON shards here, but this prevents an accidental
# `git add -A` from ever staging local R state, secrets, or source GeoPackages
# if one lands in this folder.
.RData
.RData.Tmp*
.RDataTmp*
.Rhistory
.Rproj.user/
*.Rproj
.Renviron
.env
.env.*
*.gpkg
*.parquet

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.tmp
*.tmp.*
*.bak
